{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominar Sanctum</strong> is a dark fantasy hybrid of <strong>dungeon management</strong>, <strong>real-time strategy</strong>, and <strong>third-person action</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the shadow of the Sanctum Mountains, a power awakens. Carve out your domain, command loyal minions, and shape the world to your will. Gather resources, defend your territory, and expand your influence \u2014 but beware: other powers stir in the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087340/extras/be6b80051d9bf6a6d02ec1bb24641a3d.avif?t=1760558513\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the time for battle comes, <strong>take direct control</strong> of your champions or possess your minions to fight in real-time. Unleash magic, crush intruders, and lead your forces to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087340/extras/93bd7db6980659d2b98adb09dd6d9849.avif?t=1760558513\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build. Command. Conquer.</strong><br>Your dominion awaits.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087340?t=1760558513","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087340/92843a76500f4b274ce8e419f776b414dfe02b8e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760558513","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087340/b515f4a0ca1da57817af6ab8cf44488dedbd4fc1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760558513","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087340/b515f4a0ca1da57817af6ab8cf44488dedbd4fc1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760558513","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2